.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Drosselmeyer%27s+Nutcracker+Shoppe+155+North+4th+Street+Steubenville+OH","access_notes":"Public retail shop; browsing is available during posted business hours.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"bookmarx-bookstore","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"BookMarx Bookstore","title":"Browse the Theology and Classics Shelves","subtitle":"North Fourth Street corridor — downtown bookstore","notes":"Continue along North Fourth Street and browse BookMarx’s literature, theology, Catholic, classical-language, and local-interest collections.","short_summary":"The independent shop gives the Fourth Street walk a book-focused stop.","evidence_claim":"BookMarx describes itself as a Steubenville bookstore focused on influential books, with strengths in theology, Catholic books, Latin, and Greek.","source_url":"https://bookshop.org/shop/bookmarx","source_title":"BookMarx Books","source_kind":"business_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=BookMarx+Bookstore+181+North+4th+Street+Steubenville+OH","access_notes":"Public bookstore; consult the shop directly for current opening hours and events.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"main-library-steubenville","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Public Library of Steubenville and Jefferson County — Main Library","title":"Use the Downtown Main Library","subtitle":"South Fourth Street corridor — Carnegie library","notes":"Walk South Fourth Street to read, research, or ask about the makerspace and Library of Things in Steubenville’s named Main Library building.","short_summary":"The historic downtown library adds research and making resources to the corridor.","evidence_claim":"The library’s official site lists the Main Library at 407 South Fourth Street and highlights its makerspace and Library of Things.","source_url":"https://www.steubenvillelibrary.org/?eventDisplay=venue&page=1&post_type=tribe_venue&tribe_venue=main-library","source_title":"Public Library of Steubenville and Jefferson County","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Public+Library+of+Steubenville+Main+Library+407+South+4th+Street","access_notes":"Public library; check the official site for current hours, borrowing rules, and makerspace availability.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"holy-trinity-greek-orthodox-church","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Holy Trinity Greek Orthodox Church","title":"Study the Greek-Style Architecture","subtitle":"South Fourth Street corridor — historic church","notes":"Pause at South and Fourth Streets to view the church’s classical exterior; contact the parish before planning an interior architectural visit.","short_summary":"A documented Greek congregation occupies a distinctly classical downtown landmark.","evidence_claim":"The Steubenville Visitor Center places Holy Trinity at 300 South Fourth Street and documents its classical Greek architecture and local parish history.","source_url":"https://www.visitsteubenville.com/what-to-do/historic-sites-museums/historical-steubenville-churches/","source_title":"Historical Steubenville Churches","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Holy+Trinity+Greek+Orthodox+Church+300+South+4th+Street+Steubenville+OH","access_notes":"View the exterior from public sidewalks; contact the parish before entering outside scheduled services or events.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"jefferson-county-historical-museum","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_na