itude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Naples+Spaghetti+House+329+North+Street+Steubenville+OH","access_notes":"The official page lists Tuesday–Sunday service and Monday closure; recheck hours before departure.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":["The board interprets “blocks” as named, map-listed destinations on specific campus-adjacent or downtown corridors; downtown stops require travel beyond the immediate campus edge.","Coordinates are null because exact point coordinates were not independently verified from authoritative destination pages."]}],"warnings":["All ten cards use direct supporting pages and exclude nightlife-focused or 21+-only destinations."]}
